[statement]
A package replaced does not hold up the removal of a package that provided
a name it needed at no version: `x` is removed first, though `y` 1 needed
`v`.

[repository]
P:b
V:1

P:y
V:2

[installed]
P:x
V:1
p:v
k:1

P:y
V:1
D:v

[world]
y

[request]
y>=2
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove x 1
install b 1
upgrade y 1 2
